{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/9eacd90dcc0a6880d0af5d9002805b28.poster.avif?t=1772980650\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/9eacd90dcc0a6880d0af5d9002805b28.webm?t=1772980650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/9eacd90dcc0a6880d0af5d9002805b28.mp4?t=1772980650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nightmare Getaway</i> is a first-person psychological horror game where escape is your only hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a curious adventure quickly spirals into terror when a mysterious entity abducts you and traps you inside its twisted house. Alone in the dark, you must navigate chilling corridors, solve puzzles, and confront horrors that blur the line between nightmare and reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find a way out, or will the house consume you forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/b8986cb93173e96bfbc06ffed3f2c9bf.poster.avif?t=1772980650\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/b8986cb93173e96bfbc06ffed3f2c9bf.webm?t=1772980650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/b8986cb93173e96bfbc06ffed3f2c9bf.mp4?t=1772980650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monologue &amp; Dialogue System:</strong> Experience Ethan\u2019s inner thoughts and growing dread as he struggles to make sense of his horrifying situation, while interacting with other voices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles &amp; Immersive Exploration:</strong> Search for items, solve puzzles, and uncover the house\u2019s dark secrets to find your path to freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory System:</strong> Collect, manage, and use crucial items to progress through the house, solve puzzles, and survive the horrors that await. Every object could be a key to your escape\u2014or your doom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hint System:</strong> Struggling to solve a puzzle or find a hidden clue? Subtle hints are available to guide you without breaking the tension, helping you stay immersed while progressing through the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jumpscares &amp; Trigger Events:</strong> Brace yourself for unexpected scares and scripted events that will keep you on the edge of your seat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> Immerse yourself in a chilling and unsettling environment where every shadow and sound could be your last.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/e1f0a3e5c8b546314279f8e6c44aa157.poster.avif?t=1772980650\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/e1f0a3e5c8b546314279f8e6c44aa157.webm?t=1772980650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/e1f0a3e5c8b546314279f8e6c44aa157.mp4?t=1772980650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ethan and his friend Ryan set out to explore a forgotten, abandoned area. But when a mysterious entity drags Ethan into its nightmarish house, he\u2019s left alone to face the horrors within. As he searches for escape, nightmares and reality begin to intertwine, and every step takes him deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/46cda1343112a19c2be5a0f10c135a65.poster.avif?t=1772980650\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/46cda1343112a19c2be5a0f10c135a65.webm?t=1772980650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/46cda1343112a19c2be5a0f10c135a65.mp4?t=1772980650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nightmare Getaway</i> focuses on tense, atmospheric exploration. You\u2019ll search for items, solve puzzles, and uncover secrets while navigating the house\u2019s shifting, nightmarish halls. Fear doesn\u2019t come from endless chases, but from unsettling sounds, eerie shadows, and the constant feeling that something is watching. Every step forward feels dangerous\u2014and escape is never guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/2ada50b9b76a8fddd2bc8dc5ae82eddd.poster.avif?t=1772980650\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/2ada50b9b76a8fddd2bc8dc5ae82eddd.webm?t=1772980650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/2ada50b9b76a8fddd2bc8dc5ae82eddd.mp4?t=1772980650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040100?t=1772980650","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/444b19070267f45a312051b7bb6148e03483ecf4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772980650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/e323ae2f266c7f3ed9845b8d6cecad7112181b6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772980650","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/e323ae2f266c7f3ed9845b8d6cecad7112181b6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772980650","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains horror and psychological thriller elements, including scenes with intense frightening moments. Some scenes may be unsettling for younger audiences. No sexual content or graphic violence is included; the game features displays of weapons, knife bones and more. It explores themes of fear, suspense, and survival. The game may also contain flashing lights or strobe effects that could affect players with photosensitive epilepsy."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/9eacd90dcc0a6880d0af5d9002805b28.poster.avif?t=1772980650\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/9eacd90dcc0a