th to freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory System:</strong> Collect, manage, and use crucial items to progress through the house, solve puzzles, and survive the horrors that await. Every object could be a key to your escape\u2014or your doom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hint System:</strong> Struggling to solve a puzzle or find a hidden clue? Subtle hints are available to guide you without breaking the tension, helping you stay immersed while progressing through the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jumpscares &amp; Trigger Events:</strong> Brace yourself for unexpected scares and scripted events that will keep you on the edge of your seat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> Immerse yourself in a chilling and unsettling environment where every shadow and sound could be your last.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/e1f0a3e5c8b546314279f8e6c44aa157.poster.avif?t=1772980650\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/e1f0a3e5c8b546314279f8e6c44aa157.webm?t=1772980650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040100/extras/e1f0a3e5c8b546314279f8e6c44aa157.mp4?t=1772980650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ethan and his friend Ryan set out to explore a forgotten, abandoned area. But when a mysterious entity drags Ethan into its nightmarish house, he\u2019s left alone to face the horrors within. As he searches for escape, nightmares and reality begin to intertwine, and every step takes him deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class